pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# Free-roam traffic census (docs/specs/TRAFFIC.md, SPEC-TRAFFIC) on
# acc9-stock: wake the car as fh1-physics-launch-brake, then stay parked
# for 60 s at noon and 60 s at 02:00, then cruise 30 s on part throttle
# with no steering at noon. Run hidden with
#   --game-argument=--pinyon_shift_cheats=true
#   --game-argument=--pinyon_shift_physics_trace=6
#   --game-argument=--pinyon_shift_physics_body_probe=true
# and read it with tools/re/traffic.py census <result.json>: every car of
# the world's car vector with its driver type, speed, body position, mass
# and step path, ten times a second.
# clock-hz 60
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
cvar 1 cheat_time_of_day 12
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 780 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 900 3000 vehicle
capture 1100 noon-parked
capture 4690 noon-end
cvar 4700 cheat_time_of_day 2
capture 8290 night-end
cvar 8300 cheat_time_of_day 12
input 8400 0000 0 90 0 0 0 0
capture 9600 cruise
input 10200 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 10300 cruise-end
stop 10320
